      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.875,
      "back_translation": "蜜蜂是一种重要的昆虫，它们不仅生产蜂蜜，还在生态系统中发挥着关键作用。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9512,
      "back_translation": "许多植物需要授粉才能结果，蜜蜂采蜜时会把花粉从一朵花带到另一朵花，这个过程叫做授粉。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9444,
      "back_translation": "如果没有蜜蜂，许多水果和蔬菜就无法生长。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "农业非常依赖蜜蜂的授粉服务。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8163,
      "back_translation": "例如，苹果、杏仁和蓝莓等作物大多依靠蜜蜂帮助它们繁殖。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "科学家估计，全球大约三分之一的粮食生产与蜜蜂授粉有关。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9296,
      "back_translation": "这意味着如果我们失去太多蜜蜂，食品价格可能会上涨，有些食物甚至可能变得稀缺。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8571,
      "back_translation": "近年来，研究人员发现蜜蜂的数量正在减少。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9565,
      "back_translation": "这个问题引起了广泛关注。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "许多研究正在寻找原因，可能包括农药的使用、栖息地的减少以及气候变化。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9114,
      "back_translation": "生物多样性的下降也使情况更加严重，因为单一类型的环境不利于蜜蜂和其他传粉昆虫的生存。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.7937,
      "back_translation": "为了保护蜜蜂，一些农民开始减少化学农药的使用，转向更环保的耕作方式。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9143,
      "back_translation": "在城市里，也有人开始在屋顶或阳台上养蜜蜂。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "这些做法有助于改善蜜蜂的生存环境。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9474,
      "back_translation": "同时，保护生态系统不仅是保护蜜蜂，也是保护人类自己的粮食安全。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "我们每个人都可以通过种植花草、支持生态农业来帮助蜜蜂。"
    },
